    "title": "No. 11 West Deptford defeats Haddon Heights to remain unbeaten - Field hockey recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Cosentino ,\n33 minutes ago Julia Stewart and Isabella Gibbons each scored twice as West Deptford, No. 11 in the NJ.com Top 20, downed Haddon Heights 6-1 in Haddon Heights. Gabrielle Grogan and Zoey Gibbons also scored for the Eagles, who remained undefeated at 3-0. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
